OL,3,GNEWSASchool lockdown and girls arrested
OL,4,Aafter 'threats'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers were arrested after a
OL,7,Fschool went into lockdown following
OL,8,Freports of threats.
OL,10,FSuffolk Police said it was called at
OL,11,F12:15 BST on Tuesday to Stowmarket High
OL,12,FSchool "after the school reported it
OL,13,Fhad received communications of a
OL,14,Fthreatening nature".
OL,16,FThe force said the girls, aged 13 and
OL,17,F14, were arrested at an address in
OL,18,FStowmarket on "suspicion of sending
OL,19,Fcommunication threatening death or
OL,20,Fserious harm."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
